Good day.

We received H/O visit notification from Hellman Worldwide Logistics as followings.

1. Date : 19th Nov. 2013, 3PM, HJS H/O
2. Visitors
-. Mr. Jens Pottschul, VP Regional Seafreight (Hongkong) - Transpacific E/B, Intra Asia
-. Mr. Oliver Nycolaysen, VP Regional Seafreight (Dubai) - Oceanic, Middle East and Africa
3. Agenda
-. TP E/B Biz development (Including Latin America)
-. Intra-Asia Development (Especially Oceania, Middle East, Africa)

As you can see their covering territory, the major topic will be TP E/B and Intra Asia.
Please kindly let me know who will be attending the meeting on 19 NOV within today.

Thanks a lot.


Thanks&B.Rgds
